  {
    "name": "devlanes",
    "description": "Run a devlanes command that has no tool of its own, such as infra status, remote ls, config get, debug config or lane new, or the --help of any command. Use a typed tool when there is one. Returns the command's agent output, with its JSON in structuredContent.",
